  "title": "Non-Edible Cinnamon Ornaments",
  "description": "Homemade cinnamon ornaments are an easy and fun holiday craft project. They smell wonderful and look so pretty on your Christmas tree or tied to gifts.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-30T10:55:33-05:00",
