  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon ground cloves",
    "1 tablespoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.75 cup applesauce",
    "2 tablespoons glue"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5kg-Eti-fkTFalydTVEk4UyvDU0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-11638-non-edible-cinnamon-ornaments-step-01-fc2e04f092444ed4a7ccdef51212b773.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11638/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cinnamon, cloves, and nutmeg together in a medium bowl; mix in applesauce and glue.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mVUmI_Jok6_AxZihWhfJcN8ibRE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-11638-non-edible-cinnamon-ornaments-step-02-7f43e8c5a28945cfb93559d9afbc2e0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11638/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Work mixture with your hands for 2 to 3 minutes to form a ball. If mixture is too wet, add more cinnamon. If mixture is too dry, add more applesauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TbN-Jb2TgfLckcUXRLpxw982UVU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-11638-non-edible-cinnamon-ornaments-step-03-73d026663b2d4eac8b49f78dd4e7ddf5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11638/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly dust a clean surface with cinnamon. Roll out the dough to 1/4 inch thickness. Cut out shapes with cookie cutters, and use a toothpick to make a hole at the top for hanging with a ribbon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yGdCDSx_oXRUue7sEoF2bcoMAXs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-11638-non-edible-cinnamon-ornaments-step-04-c49e5385256e4e60bdaf1c982270e81f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11638/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dry in a slow oven 200 degrees F (100 degrees C) for several hours, or air dry in a sunny spot for 4 or 5 days. When dry, decorate with gingham and/ or ribbon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rYuchMTLDaeL6pSoUOKtYSczcwc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-11638-non-edible-cinnamon-ornaments-step-05-7593befb1ef64a3da10f1b86728bc501.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11638/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
